00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.790
Huh? Where's Amelia?

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:08.460
That girl...

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.630
Working this late again?

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:19.040
Class, have you learned the order of
the dynasties that united China?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.630
Use this mnemonic to help you remember.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.790
It'll definitely be on the test!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.670
Amelia, let's finish up and head home.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.670
You can go without me if you want.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.960
I want to keep going.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:47.290
Hey... Why are you so fixated on this?

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:51.290
Everyone has one or two things that aren't their forte.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.040
Working hard is a good thing, of course,

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:57.670
but you don't have to go overboard just for a test score.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.290
What are you talking about?

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:07.290
If you try and don't get results, there's no point!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.750
Results are everything.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:13.880
Trying and not succeeding
is the same as not trying at all!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.210
I...

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.420
I want to be able to use your language too.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:24.960
Hey!

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:33.540
I wonder what's troubling Amelia.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:37.710
When she got home, she shut herself
away without eating dinner.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.630
Hey, Asahi, do you know anything?

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.920
I'll go check on her.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:51.750
I'm coming in.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.630
Everyone's worried about you.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.210
Listen, about this evening-

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.080
Leave me alone.

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:08.130
Such an asshole.

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:09.880
Oh.

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:15.920
An asshole.

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:18.080
That's what I am.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.960
I know you said what you said out of concern for me.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:28.170
But I dug in my heels and got angry and emotional.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.420
Amelia...

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:35.960
Inside, I want to thank you. I want to be honest with you.

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:39.130
But my actions are always the exact opposite.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:42.290
That's what makes me an asshole.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:43.580
I hate myself!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:47.250
Asahi, you must hate girls like me too.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.540
Self-centered girls who can't share their feelings.

00:16:50.630 --> 00:17:05.630
<b>Thunder</b>

00:16:50.630 --> 00:17:05.630
<b>Rotation</b>

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.250
I think it's fine.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:00.130
Getting emotional just means you're a sensitive person.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:04.080
Hating to lose can also be
seen as having high standards.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.250
Even digging in your heels is a sign
of your never-say-die attitude.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.170
Asahi...

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.790
You said that if don't get results,
it's pointless to have tried.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.210
But I appreciate your hard work.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.130
So it's not pointless.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.000
Not... pointless?

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:33.420
<b>Dappled</b>

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:33.420
<b>Pattern</b>

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:25.580
Oh... And, uh...

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.170
Your desire to have a good command of my language...

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.250
It kind of makes me happy.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:33.420
S-so...!

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.830
Don't say you hate yourself.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:49.960
Besides, watching you is interesting.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.460
What's up?

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:53.880
Just now...

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.330
N-nothing.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.420
Forget that. What do you mean, "interesting"?!

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.830
That's no way to describe a girl.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:02.460
Is it weird? I meant it as a compliment.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.170
It's not a compliment at all.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:08.210
In that situation, you say "you're cute" or
"I love you," even if you have to lie.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.130
Sorry, but I hate lying.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.540
Meaning what, exactly?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.000
Hey, what's that?

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:18.380
Oh, right.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:19.460
Here.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:26.630
I figured they'd make it easier to memorize kanji.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:29.000
Wow. Analog.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.080
<b>Entrust</b>

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.080
Did you make these?

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:37.580
<b>Superhuman</b>

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:37.580
<b>Feudalistic</b>

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.460
I thought it might help a little.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.880
Thanks, Asahi.

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:41.920
I'll treasure them.

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:48.580
<b>High-Pitched</b>

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.500
What did he give her?

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:48.460
I can't see from here.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:54.080
<b>Rotation</b>

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.960
What's she doing with Asahi?

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:53.710
There's only one thing a man
and woman could be doing together!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:57.540
