00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.250
What are you all doing?

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.880
Ow!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:03.710
Uh... Well, you see...

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.580
We thought she might want some pudding.

