00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.790
<b>- Any cheating will result in a failing grade regardless of points scored.</b>

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:00.540
<b>Kitchen</b>

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:05.210
What's wrong?

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:09.290
I guess it just makes me a little sad that it's ending.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.790
Then why not stick up English vocabulary next?

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.830
Oh, what a good idea.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:18.670
This time, I'll give you strict English lessons.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:23.250
Th-that reminds me. Can I help with breakfast at all?

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:26.000
Um, let me think...

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.670
I'll help, so you sit comfortably.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:31.210
But I also want to-

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.580
Forget about it, okay?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.540
I might ask you to help me make lunch.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.580
Really? I've never done that before.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:41.080
It's totally fine. You'll get the hang of it.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.380
Oh, really?

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:48.500
Now, I'll return your recent kanji tests on your tablets.

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:50.710
<b>points</b>

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:50.710
<b>Big</b>

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:50.710
<b>improvement</b>

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:50.710
<b>from last time.</b>

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.040
How did you do?

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.000
Still a ways to go, it looks like.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:56.500
Considering that, you look pretty happy.

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.000
Of course.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.580
Because I worked hard.

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:06.960
<b>You worked so hard!</b>

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:05.540
And I have someone who appreciates that.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:10.630
You know...

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.290
Amelia seems different lately.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.380
You think so?

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.830
Did something happen?

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.130
Who can say.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.080
Sheesh! Playing it cool, huh?

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:24.750
Guess you can afford to when
you're living with all those cute girls.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.880
<b>Keep studying with me, okay?</b>

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.080
At home, you must have a lucky,
erotic, age-inappropriate,

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:32.460
salmon-pink-colored life endlessly
unfolding in front of you, right?

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:35.420
Bah. And there's me at home alone.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.460
Yes, okay. I get it.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:39.790
What's up? You look happy.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:40.670
Nothing.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.580
Oh! What's your lunch today?

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:47.000
<b>Asahi</b>

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.000
Goddamn! Omurice with your name on it!

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.210
You bastard! Give me the bit with the heart!

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:50.670
Stop that. You're trashing it.

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:52.210
Don't call me trash, you dick!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.670
I didn't.

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:26.130
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:28.130
Everyone but me and him will go in a separate room.

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:28.830
What?!

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:30.000
But... I...

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.040
A goblin in the hot spring?

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:31.830
What a load of nonsense.

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:32.750
It's the goblin, Ilya!

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:33.580
Ilya!

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:34.540
Ilya!

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:35.960
Next time, episode 4:

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:38.500
"Wow! It's Huge!"

